    "ImageDescription": {
      "value": "<p>Hanoi's busy traffic taken while on the back of a \"moto\" motorcycle taxi. \n</p><p>The motos are a great, fun way to travel in Vietnam and are the prime way of getting around cheaply. It seems that no matter when you are in the country you are never far away from a moto who will stop by and offer you a ride. Thankfully they fairly universally use helmets at least in the urban areas. \n</p>\nI love zipping on the back of the 2-wheelers, weaving through the chaotic traffic.",
      "source": "commons-desc-page"
